{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21732","headline":"再酬复言 · 元稹","name":"再酬复言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绕郭笙歌夜景徂，稽山迥带月轮孤。\n休文欲咏心应破，道子虽来画得无。\n顾我小才同培塿，知君险鬬敌都卢。\n不然岂有姑苏郡，拟着陂塘比镜湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}